e-demolitions-after-soldiers-killed-in-west-bank/a-79739292?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu said Israeli forces will demolish homes in the West Bank after gunmen killed two Israeli soldiers in the West Bank city of Hebron.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>South Korea proposes military talks with North again</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c91889a4b7ca56f2e06ee422537eae2c283b105650ae1ad97f6c72c940fdafc6</id><updated>2026-10-24T04:48:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-23T07:50:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/south-korea-proposes-military-talks-with-north-again/a-79739208--5b2219c381d9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/south-korea-proposes-military-talks-with-north-again/a-79739208?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">South Korea is attempting to mutually determine the land border with North Korea amid military incidents and escalating tensions.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany sit out FIFA Under-15 World Cup as Russia return</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:bfcbb5829891b0cc8e6e5c7e967a2a9ba2ec5ee5bbe805d4ef58f38e84291a48</id><updated>2026-10-24T04:48:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-23T07:17:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-sit-out-fifa-under-15-world-cup-as-russia-return/a-79734040--d1c93bdcd718.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-sit-out-fifa-under-15-world-cup-as-russia-return/a-79734040?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Germany is one a handful of FIFA's 211 nations to refuse an invitation to play at the inaugural Under-15 World Cup. The tournament will also mark Russia's return to the FIFA fold.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry></feed>
